{"name":"重云","name_en":"Chongyun","sources":["hoyolab"],"items":[{"title":"初次见面","title_en":"","text":"我名重云，家族久居璃月，世代以驱邪除魔为业。今日萍水相逢，看来我与阁下有些缘分。唔...不收钱的，不收钱！","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/05d7199aeba671da01113c3bcda9ed01_1201924451600933715.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/15e38c689e4dc90a812798ce3c5444d9_3698277019843024782.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/2e98e2138bedc00c053cc8c0069dd865_7247835664172024453.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/a8ea51b7496dba109a5fe5280c2f4f93_6140434219258930470.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"闲聊·驱邪之法","title_en":"","text":"方士驱邪一靠咒术，二赖武艺。另辟蹊径亦可，但终非正道。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/6c9ccd92a30a05f0654c8781e1e3e921_2637643994084705991.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/ba4e3de180db859ae75e26fa2c6b47a9_6621417255152930230.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/216bd2135f88469efb139af2b2cc100c_8777366229864257031.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/8340f8a2c4adb857da815f27a373be39_2976947444267775285.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"闲聊·饮食","title_en":"","text":"寒食饮冰利于平神静气...清心泡水辅以冰块饮下，对身体最好。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/752e43de9159eea85ba9a58a4bc3e5c4_3833376671661019914.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/2bdd6b3b855874623b56cff6e3d23694_9146071874160968493.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/4c0e55c21fee0da41cb89811793f0118_4898858282039760775.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/f0dce24698a165d62db8dabc5eb5713b_8689394525674058148.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"闲聊·口诀","title_en":"","text":"驱邪缚魅，内外澄清，啊，呃...糟了，后半句口诀忘了。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/64f72f556d29a7488cde8c4769292bbc_7633699838108776994.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/d8665acb97e014346ef327b9355a6337_7207770102425488294.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/7cb65214543627cbb63b00fea076265c_1916158157659305462.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/49874b995b7750d27acc7b9480c27552_7990865059234110721.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"下雨的时候","title_en":"","text":"雨是无根水，是最澄净的水，对驱邪除魔大有帮助。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/8a7952ee11278b0cd0bb8db61f0d90dd_8902865606617925068.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/4f85128947a30bb8d240d0b64ea52bca_6660324034061746345.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/7be7d4d24e43f13688c9055debc8d977_3099236891731502050.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/611e8a1803aaad8e38aab28505713d68_8099101129041605751.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"打雷的时候","title_en":"","text":"这落雷好大阵仗，妖邪也会惧怕的吧。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/f3ebd06ba219ae41fdffc1a49c670ccd_957960401490678840.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/35e43e848084589d03f4e8c047c0f6e5_5238200711549264098.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/f3061f473b3271f7c5ea61f25a1efa9c_902870943999517081.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/ad784cc5dd9eb1463edffc60eb3a0d5f_6066688018989632697.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"下雪的时候","title_en":"","text":"啊...好天气，真是舒服。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/83c919174525af52386925eb18171d9f_1865510983150294548.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/b0caf8e47adaf36afdebb1fe11594db5_8369246484002194599.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/9b7b7ba2d4132a20c22a9d1fa350a902_415290687151759744.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/122a9cba657489efd343c8f1e56b2b9b_2688312883517397213.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"早上好","title_en":"","text":"早晨的好时光可不能辜负，抓紧练功。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/d867341aebf8227034bbb8051c71714f_4219469247443496758.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/88a32370451dd604f8b75506d0b26654_7243245916320980760.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/b6be26774d863574f6cc8bdd7676c514_3243048507632737549.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/7175e33ad1f17620d7a8b1501d9a5461_5888145869984097612.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"中午好","title_en":"","text":"正午灵气极盛，可得抓紧练功。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/a9d597a48360ef601c45482a03825b1f_5752461322938404618.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/0af5303c07a60e00f33e9f6d76f52489_5135485261578517770.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/19d51b04e476fb510079cb442f02ec3f_2102006038448952046.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/9d6779cb2c1283147b7e9d216a4eb186_1389929002315495612.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"晚上好","title_en":"","text":"晚间最适静息凝神，更要抓紧练功。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/4f997ee0b91c29d3a054049d954ef3c2_6258531045640280077.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/467038a6639edd046ab5943d1e58ce50_9141012032511407230.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/98bd16e9c62cd1989cd34e0ab5a9840b_2338210330557311841.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/3de4ecda3b38734a41fa746d0b013ec7_6593015846454519031.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"晚安","title_en":"","text":"呼，累了一整天，你也休息去吧。明天再去传闻中鬼怪出没的老宅看看，说好了。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/f52b92de10cebcb65e9bb792230a0a6c_8543575774851670891.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/f39d87fde0dcbcf315977fa057c402d1_7860327512893391024.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/7c3d268760834e4f896813a51295212b_4445645248667726697.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/991a4d2a6d5a44e2dbf2b0e75d873ad7_8922857172046430708.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"关于重云自己·方士","title_en":"","text":"我们方士一派自古守护璃月，传承久远，剿杀邪魔自然是手到擒来。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/eb024d35cc0fcf99811766f9129f8fdf_4288701637389132423.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/70f8e23196efed33f467ff9c1ab26634_1504587135194826538.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/bb9966e38d999d80aeeff8289e01530f_4296877390849428342.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/878d5518f4daa73bfadb26c8dd8dd0c0_2117887928291275861.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"关于重云自己·委托","title_en":"","text":"明明什么都没做，只是进了凶宅的门就解决了问题。这个委托的报酬，你觉得是拿还是不拿呢？","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/3debaf46ae1dbc63328b8eb2c3c46ccc_7260043761362749149.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/b543fb299dc458d5c88374604468e041_8806843274728497162.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/e90c1fdc3422cff4e212476ea02988d9_6777131258584494375.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/f40734363f232c25306566f7aa7e055e_4651515795045138526.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"关于我们·旅伴","title_en":"","text":"你的本事不错，对丘丘...咳...邪魔从不手软，我们结伴而行如何。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/a52bec964287157f116bd5e1116f4a1c_8847880245480521968.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/e7607c41fdb82e8ed871c4ddcf6df9eb_5341130230589628077.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/a5af5cc948bae1ed468343f71909b113_4892192350330913381.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/d69d1474ccc858f42f6a6c40eac14ec8_7081805299493492123.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"关于我们·怪谈","title_en":"","text":"璃月的奇闻异事你已经见了不少吧，你说的那些方外的鬼怪，我...我也想看看。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/53e8d603e34afe79f6de3678520b38e2_8271142738378379303.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/a14cea64e13ede4cef32408963415268_2523563115715905325.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/b8f5f5017993643ac1c83edb975a9bed_9073537253505190829.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/7c2d553e6a58898a4d46c37b32b8c59e_2749604915017756214.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"关于「神之眼」","title_en":"","text":"「神之眼」虽然厉害，却不可盲目依赖。我还是更加信任方术和武技。本事要精进，还是得勤学苦练。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/e0206128b83e495073abf598e5e9e251_5292314363744252867.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/ed3159ff4dc4a91a1672b78d703831c8_3490778154822515970.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/53e0a3f7d6f9f227a9c36f2f9eaa1091_5279393239485690242.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/66e02025653cfab8289e34d086f42054_9203949842952445446.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"有什么想要分享","title_en":"","text":"璃月的土地上妖邪传闻虽然众多，但真假掺杂，有些奇奇怪怪的委托...其实跟鬼怪一点关系也没有。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/4aaf648717b73da98c8c02343851ace7_1209514397836617272.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/341544b2633569499795cceddb2c74cc_6271064366378694995.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/057fad8b46467b60d1959ba3721819dc_8914971285800496001.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/ef0115cfd601117a95bccc200970f996_6287310576712451607.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"感兴趣的见闻","title_en":"","text":"听说琥牢山的琥珀中封存了不少稀奇古怪的东西，会不会也有一些历史传说中的妖邪呢？真想见识见识。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/2ff7328df59615c4f36957eee9e88bc1_1208249167317991156.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/e7e585b2d0f53c057ce712ed2d2ddc9e_7236410190713093886.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/f99c9a37de83b8541855c1b21159ea33_5994010679603786142.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/a0838d0e3019eaeb095e6cf3c9865596_5041369025841914199.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"关于钟离","title_en":"","text":"「往生堂」的钟离先生啊，隐约觉得是个厉害角色，凡夫恶党杀人，我们方士除妖，他居然能葬仙人。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/3644a039a1cb86e71137b6fe3d6ed4e1_1930389025999069830.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/fe03926ecc55bb495335c62c0b5505a9_4078310220477193490.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/2013efad4eae903e1696673ad0766703_7773525199301854362.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/175db52a319d2aa1e827430e318bb910_2581756945546524799.mp3"}},"line":0},{"title":"关于行秋","title_en":"","text":"我虽然敬佩行秋的武艺和侠心。但是我一定要事先提醒你，他坏心思也不少。如果真的发生了什么事情，记得回来和我结成受害者同盟啊。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/502493af3a390835bfe54da91b783093_7240573448792689361.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/8c2011716210f3e1a2cff85000dd6f8c_6997733451230495709.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/7cb83e1c53ba9596a9567748f319ac65_3709799269074428158.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/f8dffe6b8e68884de3e2ff1e9e505ee5_5302850364832198986.mp3"}},"line":1},{"title":"关于魈","title_en":"","text":"降魔大圣和我们方士一派，一暗一明，共守璃月，历史已久，我非常尊敬魈上仙。但是，那位大人居然说...居然说什么驱邪方士量小力微不值一提，我，我绝对不能苟同！","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/6abed9e59188fc50af10db4725ee85dd_5198676428699287195.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/3a0ce29d137ad61ad5de5b84ffd7483e_4482186648773651096.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/e22db813afdb2a206fbaa2bfdbac2f96_8945178544831186403.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/4b64f971a48e3b4227f579251f3bc9b0_9035602707670327425.mp3"}},"line":2},{"title":"关于胡桃","title_en":"","text":"「往生堂」的手段还是信得过的。但是那副「不用你们方士操心」的嘻嘻笑脸却看着让人火大...呼，冷静冷静。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/0386edee65225d779c6a33e41911f7b6_7426033490140302394.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/d473510c61a407d3ebe01ce64e141199_3394263172622682781.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/007e9f5deefcc161e960b575ca80788d_8282579381052390042.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/eb81e5d730461eb901469f19fecd4f7b_5322882131919252981.mp3"}},"line":3},{"title":"关于七七","title_en":"","text":"看起来是个僵尸小姑娘，但作为方士我能察觉到...她可不一般。嗯...名字也不见宝诰之中，究竟是哪尊呢...","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/2716d143cc983130b357bdaf082a9da7_7724017361399020162.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/d60717642b4d4302e1b46a0b6f7d1bea_971853867555707057.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/6e9d1c2c798fd2467cf265f9791934de_4080211808071761087.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/7978c0e31b3b5c929b23da82db9c69e8_2800252006867327079.mp3"}},"line":4},{"title":"关于辛焱","title_en":"","text":"我会尽可能避开辛焱演出的区域。那般热烈的气氛，即使无意融入，也难免受其影响...我是说，会让人不自在。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/40aec76bd7d9c6eff2c51c889f56f482_4006454454892233159.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/aa5a82482a4923d7a5248276f2e335ce_1586916417618967990.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/c71bf6444441db097670c8aa6c19efcd_1964569953451923188.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/97b1eb43e1ca670f3ba7f6febcf7cf02_8904297993973828084.mp3"}},"line":5},{"title":"关于香菱","title_en":"","text":"香菱做菜的手艺有口皆碑，但是她那些辛辣烫口的菜品我是绝对不会碰的...没有，没有什么...你看，史莱姆滑蘑菇？这能吃吗？","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/bd68c16dce1f3bfe2710e2292125d043_2480465806673205167.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/b28df70102533c074a9d8d96021626fc_8641464315142497501.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/f3fb7ba552ad45d9af8731934e9cf09a_5331001533768154848.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/16c7138cd4259a02d4e9b4066af2200f_4108531213997490777.mp3"}},"line":6},{"title":"关于申鹤","title_en":"","text":"我曾听家中长辈聊起过她。她家的遭遇...很让人同情。原以为这次能够让分家的远亲重回家中，长辈们听说她还活着也都高兴坏了，说是要备上礼物，择个吉日好好聚聚。却没想到，平日根本见不到她的人影...等等，按辈分来算的话，我、我该不会...要叫她「小姨」吧...","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/7db40f3f224d3f5e6d0133789e5cdccc_7719865400518624737.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/1b92762bb86c7541e23213320088099c_6601227088043992739.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/67f1938910c4fc80457e76468ba0e8d0_1020142994867629625.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/271b3aa618bd47350a08b25f739244ed_4220840888604313370.mp3"}},"line":7},{"title":"关于夜兰","title_en":"","text":"我初任方士那会儿，受邀到委托人家中驱邪，离开时，曾撞见过这位女性。她把我的名字记在某个小册子里，或许是想确认我有没有做值得怀疑的事吧。不过就那一次，后来再没遇见过她。现在想想，大概是因为我平日打坐总是一动不动，谁看着都会觉得无趣吧。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/c1b50a7db8de2da1ebba62c28d7dc410_4338384175504493200.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/c0bc4815c443cecad754950d1562ad41_1956623278812392750.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/cf2b89729e30ad835c2593651122f7b1_8981412110706298494.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/c13f0f90ad01cca39b185213be781826_2255552578551296627.mp3"}},"line":8},{"title":"想要了解重云·其一","title_en":"","text":"本事很重要，不然空有热血，只会坏事。对于这点，我深有体会。啊，倒不是我自己的体会，呃...是近年行走璃月，观看人间百态的感悟。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/9c89126fcfe62fe1c04db0c3ddf4f039_2944339619515727397.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/6fd3c10fa4dd35566d9ad34e1be68a6a_8684769954683970301.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/4a932ce5d44a25a77f9361ccbb56653a_4077384226889225330.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/a51ea4a0b5dcfba703de2bb057ad3ef6_4862560725231784466.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"想要了解重云·其二","title_en":"","text":"我天生是「纯阳之体」，据说千年难遇，所有鬼怪对我退避三舍。唉...这其实一点都不好，哪有见不着鬼怪的驱邪方士。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/79acaa593b2ecd49c706b729292668c5_4096904741666289753.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/ac5a99fd864364e48137311a07c9b532_3459589402454921550.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/755bf5a616668ac41f49bcf44a79a7d9_4004960826725800854.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/be166443b14c0e3554513fada26fe406_7684570149986383292.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"想要了解重云·其三","title_en":"","text":"「纯阳之体」常常导致热血太盛，没少害我出糗。我不食辛辣高温、出门撑伞、回避激荡的音律，就是为了克制它。唉...什么时候这体质才能不妨碍我呢？","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/768712f081b3c62e0cb888d6738f918e_3869344824663253391.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/4a22ab98a40d7a3e48947e9143b2c061_3001750173366525174.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/c469e1ca7d500132750d3720ff84dce2_5725920103624896441.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/0867fe0418047ada12f6bcfe74004681_4139132317831917450.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"想要了解重云·其四","title_en":"","text":"坐等妖邪现身是没用的，得主动寻访。我为璃月人镇邪，于人能免去烦愁，于我也能广开视野。如果你遇到邪祟搅扰，我一定也会立刻来帮你。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/f312595efa0612747eb1a01b86a706f4_3911985596762457292.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/5cf42c88f7587ec44c3f152d0a4bb7a8_2925725673788427202.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/358e28ab12fb537e5a2978b10ceaf6a2_7461433458508647714.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/3f450af6d15ff343bb1f5f0c25784ab2_8810783680423591381.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"想要了解重云·其五","title_en":"","text":"剿灭天下妖邪是我身为方士的最终目标，将来这个宏愿实现之后，不管是温泉、绝云椒椒还是别的什么...热血刺激的东西，我其实...都可以考虑。唔...不行。这样想想就会有些激动...不好不好。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/eb2c906fa66d5e469b1d2c5e5e01bdb9_7970581373294939553.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/c0bc0402a8a35fa921f09c027915eec9_8973082435852412132.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/6fce2798c0ea1eb963c042798159b6c4_799616718277451115.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/59697d551205475adbd1f6fef7ff3fac_8819564088315511414.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"重云的爱好","title_en":"","text":"我？嗯...我最喜欢的还是听说书。茶博士总是能把各种奇闻怪谈讲得惊心动魄。有空不妨一道去听听。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/e1d119e0a1ead2faa28f8bbfad52aba4_7073754304926270163.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/1925c905e1d5d2912797fae9b9aba2a9_4417410597520726148.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/aea0224e6ac3fffca4ffe246e49c1773_9053770095485319052.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/aa4eba5e6fc5c60e7dd7ef25ae922f5b_5419084113665337161.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"重云的烦恼","title_en":"","text":"经我多方打听，费了好大功夫，才找到一处破庙有妖邪出没！于是，我守了四天，却完全不见妖邪的影子。唉...这种事经常发生。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/d13bfe08f6edef5b85d930db17fe0fb1_599147975966753580.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/7d957d246f6ef4b4b46d15d809c40076_2389786318733777539.mp3","ja":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/4281a229b01320924371fe67e6b20dd4_2957360826233147816.mp3","ko":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/3bdb2f16ab56c2ef46113861876446c0_7440465086521978345.mp3"}},"line":null},{"title":"喜欢的食物","title_en":"","text":"每日修行完毕后，要是能吃上稻妻运来的生鲜还有冷餐就好了，那种冰凉清爽的口感能缓解所有疲劳。","text_en":"","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/9c56eb42538dcd0ec22cbca98bc5f7d8_9037405731912110994.mp3","en":"https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/10/09/3d